Name: Bazel Tools (singlejar, ijar and zipper)
Short Name: bazel_tools
Version: 7.4.1
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: No
Shipped: no
URL: https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/tree/7.4.1/src/tools/singlejar,
     https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/tree/7.4.1/third_party/ijar

Description:
Native command-line tools built from the Bazel source tree:
* singlejar: combines multiple .jar files into a single .jar.
  https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/tree/7.4.1/src/tools/singlejar
* ijar: creates an interface .jar containing only the ABI (method and field
  signatures) of the classes in an input .jar, which allows compile steps to
  avoid being re-run when only method bodies change.
  https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/tree/7.4.1/third_party/ijar
* zipper: a minimal zip archiver/extractor. Entries are stored uncompressed
  unless the "C" flag is passed, and every entry is given a fixed timestamp
  (2010-01-01), so archives are reproducible. Inputs can be remapped within
  the archive via "zip_path=file".
  https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/blob/7.4.1/third_party/ijar/zip_main.cc

These are built by the 3pp recipe in 3pp/ and uploaded to CIPD as
chromium/third_party/android_build_tools/bazel_tools/${platform}, with one
package per platform (linux-amd64 and mac-arm64).

Local Modifications:
None
